<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>About Us | Kaiki Guest</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f5f6f8;
    color: #172b49;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

header {
    background: #101e35;
    color: white;
    padding: 20px 7%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #d9b76e;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
}

nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-left: 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
}

nav a:hover {
    color: #d9b76e;
}

.hero {
    min-height: 380px;
    background: linear-gradient(
        rgba(10, 25, 46, 0.85),
        rgba(10, 25, 46, 0.85)
    );
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 50px 20px;
    color: white;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(35px, 6vw, 55px);
    color: #e2c27e;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.hero p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: auto;
    font-size: 17px;
}

.gold-line {
    width: 65px;
    height: 4px;
    background: #d9b76e;
    margin: 20px auto;
    border-radius: 5px;
}

.container {
    width: 88%;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: auto;
}

.section {
    padding: 65px 0;
}

.section h2 {
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    color: #101e35;
}

.intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: auto;
}

.intro p {
    color: #647084;
    font-size: 16px;
}

.story {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 45px;
    align-items: center;
}

.story-box {
    background: #101e35;
    padding: 40px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    color: white;
}

.story-box h3 {
    color: #d9b76e;
    font-size: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.story-box p {
    color: #e1e6ed;
}

.story-content p {
    color: #647084;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.features {
    background: #101e35;
    color: white;
}

.features h2 {
    color: #e2c27e;
    text-align: center;
}

.feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
    margin-top: 35px;
}

.feature {
    background: #192d4a;
    padding: 30px 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid #30435d;
}

.feature .icon {
    font-size: 35px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.feature h3 {
    color: #e2c27e;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.feature p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #d0d7e2;
}

.stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 35px;
    text-align: center;
}

.stat {
    padding: 25px;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
}

.stat h3 {
    font-size: 32px;
    color: #b28b42;
}

.stat p {
    color: #647084;
}

.cta {
    background: #e9edf2;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 65px 20px;
}

.cta h2 {
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.cta p {
    color: #647084;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #c39b51;
    color: #101e35;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 13px 30px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    font-weight: bold;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.btn:hover {
    background: #e2c27e;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
}

footer {
    background: #101e35;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px;
    color: #d0d7e2;
    font-size: 13px;
}

footer strong {
    color: #d9b76e;
}

@media(max-width: 750px) {
    header {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
    }

    nav {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 12px;
    }

    nav a {
        margin: 0;
    }

    .story {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .feature-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .stats {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .section {
        padding: 45px 0;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">KAIKI GUEST</div>

    <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="rooms.html">Rooms</a>
        <a href="about.html">About Us</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
    <div>
        <h1>Welcome to Kaiki Guest</h1>
        <div class="gold-line"></div>
        <p>
            Where comfort meets hospitality.
            Experience a welcoming environment designed
            to make every stay memorable.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container intro">
        <h2>Who We Are</h2>
        <div class="gold-line"></div>
        <p>
            Kaiki Guest is committed to providing guests
            with a welcoming accommodation experience.
            We believe that every guest deserves comfort,
            respect and quality hospitality.
            Whether you are staying for one night or longer,
            our goal is to make you feel at home.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container story">

        <div class="story-box">
            <h3>Our Story</h3>
            <p>
                At Kaiki Guest, hospitality is more than
                providing a place to sleep. It is about
                creating an environment where people feel
                welcomed, valued and comfortable.
            </p>
            <br>
            <p>
                Every detail of our guest experience
                reflects our commitment to making
                accommodation simple, convenient and
                enjoyable.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="story-content">
            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <div class="gold-line" style="margin-left:0"></div>
            <p>
                To provide welcoming, comfortable and
                affordable accommodation while maintaining
                high standards of hospitality and customer
                service.
            </p>

            <h2>Our Vision</h2>
            <div class="gold-line" style="margin-left:0"></div>
            <p>
                To become a trusted accommodation destination
                recognised for excellent guest experiences,
                reliability and outstanding hospitality.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section class="section features">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Why Choose Kaiki Guest?</h2>
        <div class="gold-line"></div>

        <div class="feature-grid">

            <div class="feature">
                <div class="icon">🛏️</div>
                <h3>Comfortable Rooms</h3>
                <p>
                    Accommodation options designed to
                    provide a comfortable and relaxing stay.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature">
                <div class="icon">🤝</div>
                <h3>Guest Care</h3>
                <p>
                    We value every guest and strive to
                    provide welcoming and respectful service.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature">
                <div class="icon">⭐</div>
                <h3>Quality Hospitality</h3>
                <p>
                    We are committed to making every
                    guest's experience a positive one.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container intro">
        <h2>Kaiki Guest at a Glance</h2>
        <div class="gold-line"></div>

        <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat">
                <h3>63</h3>
                <p>Accommodation Rooms</p>
            </div>

            <div class="stat">
                <h3>59</h3>
                <p>Single Rooms</p>
            </div>

            <div class="stat">
                <h3>4</h3>
                <p>Double Rooms</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
    <h2>Your Comfort Matters to Us</h2>
    <p>
        Make Kaiki Guest your next accommodation destination.
        We look forward to welcoming you.
    </p>
    <a href="index.html" class="btn">Explore Kaiki Guest</a>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>
        © 2026 <strong>Kaiki Guest</strong>.
        All Rights Reserved.
    </p>
    <p>Hospitality • Comfort • Excellence</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
